<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">We'll Meet Again, film</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1943</span><span class="sg-chain-h">named after it, with Vera Lynn</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Vera Lynn's re-recording with a chorus of the British armed forces</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1953</span><span class="sg-chain-h">recording</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Dr. Strangelove, film (Stanley Kubrick)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1964</span><span class="sg-chain-h">used in</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">The Byrds, Mr. Tambourine Man</span><span class="sg-chain-h">recording</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Vera (Pink Floyd, The Wall)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1979</span><span class="sg-chain-h">quoted in</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">The Singing Detective, television serial</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1986</span><span class="sg-chain-h">used in</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Vera Lynn and Katherine Jenkins</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2014</span><span class="sg-chain-h">recording (charted 2020)</span></li></ul></section>
